@Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress = http://localhost:5219

### 1. Check BOTH Redis and PostgreSQL Health at once
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/database/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Check Redis Health Only
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/database/redis
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Check PostgreSQL Health Only
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/database/postgres
Accept: application/json

###
